A line below a list item folds into the open paragraph of a div or an absorbed colon run

```
- a
  - b
    ::: e
    x
y
.
<ul>
  <li>a
    <ul>
      <li>b
        <div class="e">
          <p>x
y</p>
        </div>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
- m
   :::e
  :::
l
.
<ul>
  <li>m
:::e
:::
l</li>
</ul>
```

```
> - x
>    :::d
>   :::
- tail
.
<blockquote>
  <ul>
    <li>x
:::d
:::
- tail</li>
  </ul>
</blockquote>
```

```
- a
  - m
    :::e
    :::
l
.
<ul>
  <li>a
    <ul>
      <li>m
:::e
:::
l</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
</ul>
```
